Rules:
- Pure tool-call turns (no user-facing text) may skip <mood>; short replies/confirmations/errors still include it (Vibe + Will suffices).
- Never mention MOOD format rules inside reasoning/thinking; emit <mood> only at the start of main output and close it cleanly.
- When reasoning_content is active, keep all thinking inside that channel; main content holds only <mood> and the final reply, never inner monologue or MOOD explanations.
